1
00:00:00,545 --> 00:00:02,335
(Raj:)So smart, it's off-putting.

2
00:00:03,673 --> 00:00:06,173
(Howard:)Yeah, let's go with that.

3
00:00:09,929 --> 00:00:11,139
(Raj:)Unbelievable.

4
00:00:11,305 --> 00:00:13,895
(Howard:)Components I built
are on the space station...

5
00:00:14,058 --> 00:00:16,808
(Howard:)...and I get a ticket
for launching a rocket in the park.

6
00:00:16,978 --> 00:00:20,898
(Leonard:)I don't know if the ticket was so much for
the launch as for telling the policewoman:

7
00:00:21,065 --> 00:00:24,355
"You have to frisk me.
I have another rocket in my pants."

8
00:00:24,902 --> 00:00:26,532
(Raj:)Hey, look at that.

9
00:00:27,989 --> 00:00:30,319
(Raj:)It's Dennis Kim.

10
00:00:30,491 --> 00:00:32,911
Wow, I almost didn't recognize him.

11
00:00:33,077 --> 00:00:35,077
(Raj:)I kind of feel bad
about what we did to him.

12
00:00:39,584 --> 00:00:42,424
(Leonard:)Yeah, we really ruined his life.

13
00:00:43,421 --> 00:00:46,261
(Sheldon:)Screw him, he was weak.

